# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for `make concurrency-tsan` (GQLITE-T-0528).
#
# SQLITE_EXTENSION_INIT2 (SQLite's macro for loadable extensions) stores the
# host's API table pointer in one global each time a connection loads the
# extension. Every load stores the same pointer, so the race is benign; it
# is how every SQLite extension works.
race:sqlite3_graphqlite_init
